#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:2
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "贡献指南"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:4
msgid ""
"Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) first: it holds the repository's rules and "
"security boundaries. The [developer guide](docs/developer/development.md)"
" covers local setup, the checks each kind of change needs, and what CI "
"runs."
msgstr ""
"请先阅读 "
"[AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md)：仓库的规则和安全边界都在那里。[开发者指南](docs/developer/development.md)介绍本地环境、每类改动需要的检查，以及"
" CI 会运行什么。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:8
msgid ""
"Branch from `dev` as `<user>/<scope>/<name>`, and keep the change to one "
"feature, fix or documentation update."
msgstr "从 `dev` 创建分支，命名为 `<user>/<scope>/<name>`，每次改动只做一项功能、修复或文档更新。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:10
msgid ""
"Cover the behavior you change with tests. Fix regressions instead of "
"weakening assertions."
msgstr "用测试覆盖你改动的行为。出现回归就修复它，不要削弱断言。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:12
msgid ""
"Update affected contracts, migrations and documentation in the same "
"change. A schema change is a new additive Alembic migration; service "
"startup never creates or alters the schema. Document new environment "
"variables in [ENVIRONMENT.md](ENVIRONMENT.md)."
msgstr ""
"在同一个改动里更新受影响的契约、迁移和文档。schema 改动要写成新的增量 Alembic 迁移；服务启动时从不创建或修改 "
"schema。新增的环境变量要写进 [ENVIRONMENT.md](ENVIRONMENT.md)。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:16
msgid ""
"Run `make check` and the other checks your change needs ([Run the "
"relevant checks](docs/developer/development.md#run-the-relevant-checks))."
" Review the formatting and lint fixes it applies."
msgstr ""
"运行 `make check` 以及改动需要的其他检查（见[运行相关检查](docs/developer/development.md#run-"
"the-relevant-checks)），并检查它自动应用的格式和 lint 修复。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:19
msgid ""
"Open a pull request against `dev`. Describe the resulting behavior, and "
"list the checks you ran and their results. The [pull request "
"template](.github/pull_request_template.md) has the checklist."
msgstr ""
"向 `dev` 提交 pull request。描述改动后的行为，并列出你实际运行的检查及其结果。[pull request "
"模板](.github/pull_request_template.md)里有检查清单。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:23
msgid ""
"Commit subjects and pull request titles use the conventional format, "
"`type(scope): summary`. Pull requests are squash merged, so the title "
"becomes the commit subject on `dev`; `main` advances through the manual "
"[fast-forward workflow](.github/workflows/sync-main.yml)."
msgstr ""
"提交标题和 pull request 标题使用约定式格式：`type(scope): summary`。pull request 以 squash"
" 方式合并，所以标题会成为 `dev` 上的提交标题；`main` 通过手动的[快进工作流](.github/workflows/sync-"
"main.yml)前进。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:28
msgid "Treat every commit as public: never commit secrets, tokens or keys."
msgstr "把每次提交都当作公开的：绝不要提交机密信息、令牌或密钥。"

